      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_battleend_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "47523D001B3439F9",
      "text": "居然能赢过辛俐我，打得不错嘛！\\n我真心地恭喜你！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
